级为“顶级”，并补充了“擅长构建沉浸感画面”的能力描述，激发模型输出更高质量的词汇。\n结构化指令：将原本笼统的“详细描述...”拆解为5个具体的创作维度（主体、环境、构图、光影、风格），引导AI更有条理地填充细节。\n引入专业术语：加入了“景别”、“镜头语言”、“体积光”、“景深虚化”等摄影与美术专业词汇，能显著提升生成画面的质感。\n明确负向约束：更严格地规定了“仅输出正文”、“无前缀”、“无水印描述”，确保你拿到的结果可以直接复制使用。", "one by one", 24, 256, 975877763459953, "randomize", false, false], "inputs": [{"name": "llama_model", "link": 103, "label": "llama_model", "type": "LLAMACPPMODEL", "localized_name": "llama_model"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "parameters", "link": 104, "label": "parameters", "type": "LLAMACPPARAMS", "localized_name": "parameters"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "images", "link": 116, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "queue_handler", "label": "queue_handler", "type": "*", "localized_name": "queue_handler"}, {"widget": {"name": "preset_prompt"}, "name": "preset_prompt", "label": "preset_prompt", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "preset_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_prompt"}, "name": "custom_prompt", "label": "custom_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "custom_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "system_prompt"}, "name": "system_prompt", "label": "system_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "system_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "inference_mode"}, "name": "inference_mode", "label": "inference_mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "inference_mode"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_frames"}, "name": "max_frames", "label": "max_frames", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_frames"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_size"}, "name": "max_size", "label": "max_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_size"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "force_offload"}, "name": "force_offload", "label": "force_offload", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "force_offload"}, {"widget": {"name": "save_states"}, "name": "save_states", "label": "save_states", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "save_states"}], "flags": {}, "id"